%% A contract is an account, and it can spend. The sequence matters more than the
%% cast: the inner payment is submitted by the AVM during the app call, from the
%% application's own address, and it settles before the call returns.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant A as Application<br/>(app ID 1234)
    participant AA as Application account<br/>(its own address)
    participant R as Recipient

    U->>A: App call: claim()
    Note over A: fee covers the inner txn<br/>as well as this one
    A->>A: check the caller, read state
    A->>AA: itxn: Payment, fee 0
    AA->>R: 5 ALGO
    Note over AA,R: settles inside this app call,<br/>not in a later transaction
    A-->>U: approve
    Note over U,R: reject anywhere above and the<br/>payment is undone with everything else
